1053.description:
Heroes of Might and Magic 3: Restoration of Erathia is back, ready to welcome a new army of fans and reunite with loyal fans! DotEmu has created an HD version of the renowned turn-based strategy game. A huge thank you to this developer! Released in January 2015, it celebrated the 20th anniversary of the celebrated series. The third installment is its crowning glory. Note that Restoration of Erathia is the original version of this installment. Several expansions are also included.

The remake is faithful to the source material, with only the graphics updated. For those unfamiliar with the world of Heroes of Might and Magic 3, it's called Enroth, home to a variety of fantastical creatures: unicorns, griffins, dragons, dwarves, elves, demons... Among them, some good, some evil, and others constantly at war. The plot is divided into seven campaigns. The main focus is on Queen Catherine, whose father has died. Taking advantage of this opportunity, dark forces have begun to seize territory. Catherine must protect her homeland.

Features of the HD version:
- Everything is the same as in the original: 7 campaigns, 50 maps, a sea of heroes and units... Only the graphics are adapted for modern widescreen monitors.
- Multiplayer has been updated. Steamworks support is now available, allowing you to connect and compete with gamers from hundreds of countries.
The game doesn't require a powerful system, so users with average computers can easily download the Russian version of Heroes of Might and Magic 3 via torrent, as it will run smoothly on maximum settings.

Repack features:
- Based on a license from GOG Complete Edition;
- All campaigns of Heroes of Might and Magic 3 are present: Restoration of Erathia, Armageddon's Blade, Breath of Death;
- Nothing cut / nothing re-encoded;
- Game version: 4.0 (28740 on GOG);
- HD-mod version 5.0 RC90 is built-in, you can run it with or without it;
- Installation time: 1 minute (depending on the computer).

