A fun, romantic and optimistic life simulator inspired by The Sims.

ORDINARY LIFE
Download Circadian City Download free torrent in Russian and experience the joy of starting your own life. Having moved to the big city after graduating from university, you find a job at a strange company and try to make new connections. In the evenings, after a busy day at work, you try to figure out the purpose of your existence.

What daily chores look like:
- satisfy natural needs such as hunger, thirst, cleanliness, thirst for communication and feelings of emotional comfort;
- earn your own money;
- pay attention to your hobbies;
- make friends who share your interests;
- lead a healthy lifestyle, taking care of your body;
- control the level of psychological stress.

THE WORLD OF DREAMS
Circadian City Opens you to a procedurally generated dream world. This means that everything you experience or observe in everyday life will influence your dreams. Your personality and dreams are formed in your dreams, and various possibilities emerge: for example, you could be a caring farmer with your own ranch or an ambitious businessman.

What awaits you in the dream world:
- build your life in the mental world;
- come up with incredible objects;
- wander around procedurally generated locations;
- meet mysterious characters;
- choose one of 16 paths of personal development;
- find a purpose in life.

